WEBVTT

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.620
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.910
where King Kyle defeated the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:25.700
The Demons rise again, threatening the world,
spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.660
In order to investigate the Demonic threat,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:32.950
the Guardian Knights of Orvelia decided to
go on an expedition to the Galluah Plains.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:37.450
The Black Edge was chosen
to serve as the vanguard.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:44.830
You all went from cold stares to hero.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.200
I'm sure it makes your drinks taste better.

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:52.410
Once the Demons are gone,
everyone will forget what we did.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:56.740
That's why we need absolute status.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.910
<i></i>The Entrance

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.910
<i></i>to the Abyss

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.490
Demon! The Black Edge will defeat you!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.700
Same here! The Black Edge will defeat you!

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.660
That makes no sense!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.330
It's the Black Edge!

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.790
Awesome!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.700
It's the real one!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.160
So cool!

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.830
What are they doing here?

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:16.290
Princess Scarlet invited them.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.870
Greetings, everyone.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.080
I've brought my companions.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:33.740
Good work. The princess will
greet you now. Your Highness.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:38.290
I am Scarlet. Thank you all for coming.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.160
Yo!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:48.290
Good to finally meet you, Princess!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.120
Hey, read the room!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.790
--Cut it out.
--The princess should have the right to choose.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.740
I suppose?

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.660
Stop.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:12.700
Riheet did mention how brave you are.

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:17.040
I hope to see that energy put to
good use in this upcoming expedition.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.330
Yeah, count on it!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:21.910
Can't say no to a pretty princess!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:23.790
Insolent fools...

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.830
It's fine.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.910
Everyone, listen up.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:33.120
Within the knightly order, I am not a princess.
I am the supreme commander.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.410
I will be accompanying you on
this investigation of the Demons.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:39.950
I hope to be on good terms with you.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:46.330
Tomorrow morning, we depart
and head towards Galluah Plains.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:52.160
This expedition could determine the nation's--
no, the fate of the entire world.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.330
Demia will explain the details.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.200
Demia.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.580
Yes!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.580
Our goal is the ruins of the Republic
of Grey in the Galluah Plains.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:05.790
We will take the road facing the Forest
of Elidora and enter the plains.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:09.620
From there, we will head straight towards
the castle in the Republic of Grey.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:14.200
That castle is exactly where the Dark Lord
Angmund appeared 100 years ago.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:18.200
The Demons destroyed the nation,
so the entire area is in ruin now.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:21.620
If there is a force there attempting
to bring back the Dark Lord,

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:25.330
we must stop them, at all costs.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.700
You will be our vanguard.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:32.240
I must admit, however, that I have some
worries about your ability to coordinate.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:37.120
There's no need for that. We'll bring back
some Demon heads as a souvenir.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.290
You should just wait here for us.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:43.950
Yeah, no need for the whole party.
We'll be fine alone!

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:47.740
They don't seem committed to the idea
of being part of the knightly order.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.040
Agreed.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:51.790
This is worrying.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.410
You there.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.450
Hmm? Me?

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:01.870
Yes. Help me get warmed up.

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.870
Clause, you will observe.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.490
Yes.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:14.290
You should know, the princess is tough.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.080
Don't let your guard down,
or you could get hurt.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:20.660
Hah. I look forward to that.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.080
Give me everything you've got.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.620
And... begin!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.740
You're light on your feet.

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:41.040
But your strike is also light.
You don't have to hold back.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:46.490
Come on, I'd be in trouble if you got hurt!

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.490
Wow...

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:03.910
Impressive.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.950
You...!

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.080
Stop!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:33.870
What's wrong, Azal? Scared of the princess?

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.080
That's not your style!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.450
I just went easy on her!

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:43.040
Does anyone else want a match?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:52.450
I trust in you. I hope you will
trust in us knights as well.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.910
I see. That's why you did this.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:01.700
The quickest way to earn your trust
is to show my power, is it not?

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.370
Interesting princess.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.790
It's true, she's definitely not a pushover.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:15.160
Lord Moriham, why did you call us here?

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.870
I must discuss something with
you regarding the Black Edge.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.240
What is it?

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:25.910
You are aware that Riheet and the knights
are going to Galluah Plains, yes?

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.540
Of course.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:34.740
Because Princess Scarlet invited them into
the castle, the nobles are in an uproar!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:40.620
We are stuck with the task of calming them.
I want no more trouble.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.790
Then this will be the last time.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.240
If and when the Black Edge
return from this expedition,

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.080
I'd like to give Riheet the title
of Honorary Noble.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.740
Nobility?!

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:55.200
Why do you believe we
would allow such a thing?!

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.700
It's not an unreasonable request.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:03.870
I'm just saying, the savior of the nation
should have the appropriate standing.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:08.830
I oppose this! We allowed those
mercenaries to join the knights!

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.290
Isn't that enough?!

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:16.950
He's right! Lord Moriham,
why are you so supportive of them?!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.290
For the nation, of course.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:25.240
To defend our kingdom from the Demons,
the Black Edge must remain on our side.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:28.830
Lord Schmidt, I'd like to hear your opinion.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.410
M-Me...?

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.660
I... I agree.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:36.260
Huh?

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.870
Lord Schmidt?!

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.120
Yes, thank you!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.120
Speak truthfully. What are you plotting?

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:52.910
There is no plot. All I desire
is world peace, Lord Menos.

00:09:54.160 --> 00:10:00.490
Your wealth, your land... Those things
are valuable to you, are they not?

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:05.040
Only those who side with me
would be able to protect them.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.120
The Black Edge will be great guard dogs.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:13.160
Th-The chancellor will never
allow that to happen...

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:17.290
In that case, we would need to
remove him from the picture.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:20.370
This nation will now be driven by us.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:24.040
We can create the nation we desire.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:30.580
The four of us, with the strongest soldier--
no, hero by our side.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.540
Your Highness, please wait!

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:33.580
I will not wait.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:37.490
Your Highness, please rethink this!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:41.950
You yourself heading out
to the Galluah Plains...?

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:47.080
We've discussed that many times already.
Have you forgotten? Have you gotten that old?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:53.370
Certainly not! I am well aware of
your role as supreme commander.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:59.870
However, should you be injured,
the king's heart would be so deeply hurt...

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:04.160
Father will understand.
You are the only stubborn one here.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.990
Your Highness...!

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:11.080
Oh, if only we had the Holy Sword Aea...
None of this would...

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:18.700
We can't just wish for something we don't have.
We must defend our own nation!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:23.660
Clause! Great timing. I need to
discuss tomorrow's plans with you.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.490
Yes.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.830
Your Highness!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:31.580
Stubborn, just like your father...

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:40.290
Thank you. As you see, Behl worries too much.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:44.740
The chancellor cares for you sincerely,
from the bottom of his heart.

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:49.290
I know. He is a precious
retainer for me as well.

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:52.540
Um, Your Highness.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.370
What is it?

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:58.290
I have a younger friend named Kasel,
an apprentice knight.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:02.660
He went on a journey to vanquish Demons.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:07.410
This is the first time I heard that.
Did he go alone?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:11.790
No. A priestess named Frey
and some sorcerers are with him.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:16.160
Kasel wanted to defeat
the Demons in his own way.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:21.540
I didn't stopped him...
I wanted to respect his decision.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:25.370
Why are you telling me this?

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.990
We aren't the only ones
trying to fight the Demons.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:32.290
There are other allies out there.
That's the point of my story.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:37.490
I see. I'd like to meet
this Kasel fellow someday.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:44.040
I'm sure you will. I think Kasel
will bring hope to us all.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:49.160
I wish I could take you on this expedition,
but someone needs to defend the homeland.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.740
I'm counting on you during my absence.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:52.910
Yes!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:57.830
Riheet, a noble?!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:03.450
Yeah. I worked with Lord Moriham
and got the other nobles to agree.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.910
Awesome!

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:07.200
Impressive, Riheet.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:14.290
But in order to seal the deal, we must achieve
great victories in this expedition.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:18.200
We will return as heroes of this nation.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.120
Us, heroes.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:21.990
That doesn't matter.

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.740
No, this is important.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:30.490
Those who used to mistreat us
will instead worship us.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:34.240
We have to make sure nobody
has any standing to oppose us.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.240
That is the only way we can control this nation.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.830
There's no room for error.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:44.160
Correct.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.740
What about the princess?

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:52.490
Now that I've talked to her, I know her.
She won't behave as we want her to.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:55.620
I've already taken care of that.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.950
While Scarlet is away during this expedition,

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:02.950
Lord Moriham will take power
away from the chancellor.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:08.120
Without the chancellor's support,
no noble would side with Scarlet.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:12.870
She will lose power and be driven
from her current position.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.330
I see!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:18.700
It's too bad, I'll miss the pretty princess.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.700
Come on, we're getting up early tomorrow.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.450
Everyone rest well.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:26.660
Yes!

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:32.120
Our time is finally here.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:36.870
Ever since the day we were chased out of town,
we've been waiting for this moment.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.040
The time for revenge is near.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.740
Yes, brother...

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.910
Take care of the castle, Behl.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.910
Yes... Please take care.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:57.990
I know. Save your lectures--
I'll listen when I get back.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:05.200
This expedition is supposed to be a big one.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.620
Is it true that the princess is going, too?

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:09.040
Come on, hurry!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.740
Wait for me!

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:14.080
The Black Edge is going, too. It'll be fine.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.040
Speaking of which, here they are!

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:21.160
We're counting on you, Black Edge!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.660
Look, it's Mr. Azal!

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:34.660
Tamm! Tamm!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.910
Tamm!

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:47.410
Please be safe.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:59.910
I felt the power of the
Holy Sword Aea, for sure.

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.160
Who was that man?

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:12.290
You felt the power of the Holy Sword
from a regular human?

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:16.620
That's impossible.
The Holy Sword is still missing.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:19.410
Is that true, Maria?

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:25.740
While I was asleep, you were
searching for the Holy Sword.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:29.080
Perhaps you knew about this Kasel fellow?

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:31.450
I know nothing.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:37.580
You fell into darkness. I hope you
haven't gone back to your old self.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:41.330
Malduk, what are you afraid of?

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.910
Even if the Holy Sword Aea
did exist, it wouldn't matter.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:47.290
I know.

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:50.790
Once the Dark Lord returns, everything is over.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:37.040
We will reach the Galluah Plains
by midday tomorrow.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:41.540
Then we, the Black Edge, will act
on our own, without the knights.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:45.490
Finally, we get to split
from them. Good riddance.

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:47.040
Indeed.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:50.240
My brother is not done talking.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:58.330
As you all must know, our job is to
investigate the Demons. Understood?

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:02.490
Yeah, it's just an investigation. I know.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:05.620
I'm counting on everyone. Good luck.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.120
Yeah!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.490
I hope we get to fight some
really powerful Demons.

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:13.240
Yeah, we'll kill it and come home heroes.

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:15.410
It's almost time to eat.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.660
Yeah.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:22.580
Aren't you going, Ripine?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.120
I'll go later.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.450
Okay.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.450
What's wrong?

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:35.040
Aren't you going with the others?

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.330
I don't like crowds.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.790
I see...

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.540
You're just like Riheet.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:54.830
Like how secretive you are,
and how you have a strong will.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.490
I also don't like loud places.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:03.120
But at the same time,
quiet places make me feel lonely.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:06.450
All I need is my brother.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:11.410
You two are close.
I envy you; I have no siblings.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.790
You--

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.910
You wouldn't understand.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:25.870
You can never understand us.
Don't say things like that without knowing.

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:53.080
Proceed west on these plains to reach
the old castle of the Republic of Grey.

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.450
If you see any Demons, report to us.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:57.580
Understood.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:58.870
Riheet.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:04.870
I... Be careful.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.160
Yes.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:17.410
So this is the Galluah Plains.
Not a place where anyone can live...

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.910
It's been abandoned for 100 years.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:26.790
Not only are there no people,
but no animals are here either. And no Demons!

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:31.490
Where are those stupid skeletons?
Come out already!

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:35.410
If there are no Demons, what did
we come all the way out here for?

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.410
I hope a huge monster or something comes out.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:39.740
Yes.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.160
We can't go back until we kill our prey.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.700
The castle is still a ways off. Let's go.

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.200
Yeah.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:52.410
What's that...?

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.610
Tamm!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:05.330
Wait!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:06.410
What the hell for?!

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.240
Don't get close!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.450
Tamm! Can you move?!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:14.330
Tamm! Come on!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:16.160
Hey, Tamm!

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:18.620
Say something! Tamm!

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.330
Nobody move.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:48.490
No way... Tamm, why die here...?
We're just getting started...

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:53.700
It's my fault... I took away Tamm's future...!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:55.990
Azal, shut up.

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:58.700
It's the Demons, for sure.

00:21:58.700 --> 00:21:59.790
Riheet...

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.040
The Demon that killed Tamm must be nearby.

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:50.950
The Black Edge encounter the sorcerer Malduk.

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:57.700
Malduk's brutal and cruel attacks
are seemingly unending.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:00.870
How will this deadly battle
in the badlands end...?

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>Battle in the

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.910
<i></i>Badlands
